              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઝૂમવું (jhūmvũ) is to sway with the music, the body and the head together. CDIAL lists Hindi jhūmnā, \"to shake\", with a query, under a reconstructed kṣumbhati, \"shakes\" (CDIAL 3726); it gives no Gujarati form, so its history is not settled."
